@* 客戶入口的外殼，純呈現（不讀登入狀態）：已登入進入工作區時採用現代 AI 瀏覽器雙欄版面——
   左側為全高導覽欄（頂部為品牌與搜尋／收合控制、快速新對話鈕、上方為功能模塊、中間為原生可捲動及即時篩選對話歷史、左下角為帳號選單並向上彈出）；
   右側為主工作區舞台（精簡上下文頂欄與置中問答／內容區）。還沒登入或還有強制步驟時，只有頂欄。
   側欄每項是圖示加文字：桌機可收成窄欄、手機為全高滑出抽屜（forms.js 切換）。
   帳號與對話選單均使用瀏覽器原生的 popover（點外面或按 Esc 就關、疊在最上層、不需要 JavaScript）。
   PortalLayout／WorkspaceLayout 依登入狀態填入；元件展示頁用假資料填入。 *@
@inject NavigationManager Nav
<a class="ep-skip-link" href="#main">@L["跳到主要內容"]</a>

<div class="@(HasSideNav ? "ep-console ep-portal" : "ep-shell ep-portal")">
    @if (HasSideNav)
    {
        <div class="ep-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ep-edge" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="ep-console-body">
            <aside id="ep-side" class="ep-side">
                <div class="ep-side-head">
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(HomeHref))
                    {
                        <a class="ep-brand" href="@HomeHref"><BrandMark /><span class="ep-side-label">@Brand.Name</span></a>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <span class="ep-brand"><BrandMark /><span class="ep-side-label">@Brand.Name</span></span>
                    }
                    <span class="ep-spacer"></span>
                    @if (Recent.Count == 0 && HistoryEnabled && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(HistoryHref))
                    {
                        <a class="ep-side-icon-btn" href="@HistoryHref" aria-label="@L["搜尋對話標題"]" title="@L["搜尋對話標題"]"><NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Search" /></a>
                    }
                    <button type="button" class="ep-side-toggle" aria-controls="ep-side" aria-expanded="true" aria-label="@L["展開或收合導覽"]" title="@L["展開或收合導覽"]"><NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Menu" /></button>
                </div>

                <div class="ep-side-body">
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(HomeHref))
                    {
                        <a class="ep-side-new-chat" href="@HomeHref" title="@L["新對話"]">
                            <NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Add" />
                            <span class="ep-side-label">@L["新對話"]</span>
                        </a>
                    }
                    @if (Recent.Count > 0)
                    {
                        <button type="button" class="ep-side-link ep-recent-jump" aria-label="@L["搜尋對話（⌘K）"]" title="@L["搜尋對話（⌘K）"]">
                            <NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Search" />
                            <span class="ep-side-label">@L["篩選對話"]</span>
                        </button>
                    }

                    <div class="ep-side-modules">
                        @foreach (var group in NavItems.GroupBy(i => i.Group))
                        {
                            <p class="ep-side-group" aria-hidden="true">@group.Key</p>
                            <nav class="ep-side-nav" aria-label="@group.Key">
                                @foreach (var item in group)
                                {
                                    <NavLink class="ep-side-link" href="@item.Href" Match="@(item.Exact ? NavLinkMatch.All : NavLinkMatch.Prefix)" title="@item.Label">
                                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(item.Icon))
                                        {
                                            <NavIcon Path="@item.Icon" />
                                        }
                                        <span class="ep-side-label">@item.Label</span>
                                    </NavLink>
                                }
                            </nav>
                        }
                    </div>

                    @* 原生對話紀錄：功能模塊在上方，這裡接續在後並獨立捲動；釘選的一組在最上面，其餘依日期分組。
                       問答歷史開啟時一律渲染原生歷史區（有對話時用 ep-recent 並附側欄即時篩選，尚無對話時用 ep-history-empty 顯示引導提示）；關閉時完全不渲染。 *@
                    @if (Recent.Count > 0)
                    {
                        <section class="ep-recent" aria-label="@L["最近的對話"]">
                            <div class="ep-history-head">
                                <span class="ep-history-heading">@L["最近的對話"]</span>
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(HistoryHref))
                                {
                                    <a class="ep-history-all" href="@HistoryHref">@L["查看全部"]</a>
                                }
                            </div>
                            <div class="ep-recent-filter">
                                <label class="ep-visually-hidden" for="ep-recent-filter">@L["篩選對話"]</label>
                                <NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Search" />
                                <input id="ep-recent-filter" class="ep-recent-search" type="search" data-recent-filter maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" placeholder="@L["篩選對話"]" />
                                <kbd class="ep-kbd" aria-hidden="true">/</kbd>
                            </div>
                            @foreach (var group in Recent)
                            {
                                <p class="ep-side-group" aria-hidden="true">@group.Label</p>
                                <nav class="ep-recent-nav" aria-label="@group.Label">
                                    @foreach (var item in group.Items)
                                    {
                                        <div class="ep-recent-item">
                                            <NavLink class="ep-recent-link" href="@item.Href" title="@item.Title">
                                                @if (item.Pinned)
                                                {
                                                    <NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.PushPin" />
                                                }
                                                <span class="ep-side-label">@item.Title</span>
                                            </NavLink>
                                            <ConversationMenu Id="@item.Id" Href="@item.Href" Title="@item.Title" Pinned="@item.Pinned" />
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                </nav>
                            }
                            <p class="ep-recent-none ep-hint" data-recent-empty hidden>@L["沒有符合的對話"]</p>
                        </section>
                    }
                    else if (HistoryEnabled)
                    {
                        <section class="ep-history-empty" aria-label="@L["最近的對話"]">
                            <div class="ep-history-head">
                                <span class="ep-history-heading">@L["最近的對話"]</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="ep-history-empty-note">@L["在首頁問一個問題，它就會出現在這裡。"]</p>
                        </section>
                    }
                </div>

                @if (ShowMenu)
                {
                    <div class="ep-side-foot">
                        <button type="button" class="ep-portal-user" popovertarget="ep-account-menu" aria-label="@L["帳號選單"]">
                            <span class="ep-avatar" aria-hidden="true">@AvatarText</span>
                            <span class="ep-portal-user-info">
                                <span class="ep-portal-user-name">@(UserDisplayName ?? UserEmail)</span>
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(UserSecondaryLine))
                                {
                                    <span class="ep-portal-user-meta">@UserSecondaryLine</span>
                                }
                            </span>
                            <span class="ep-portal-user-icon" aria-hidden="true"><NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Settings" /></span>
                        </button>
                        <div id="ep-account-menu" class="ep-menu" popover>
                            <p class="ep-menu-who">
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(UserDisplayName) && !string.Equals(UserDisplayName, UserEmail, StringComparison.Ordinal))
                                {
                                    <strong>@UserDisplayName</strong>
                                }
                                <span>@UserEmail</span>
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(RoleLabel))
                                {
                                    <span class="ep-secondary">@RoleLabel</span>
                                }
                            </p>
                            <nav aria-label="@L["帳號選單"]">
                                @foreach (var item in MenuItems)
                                {
                                    <a class="ep-menu-item" href="@item.Href">@item.Label</a>
                                }
                            </nav>
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(LanguageAction))
                            {
                                <LanguageSwitch Action="@LanguageAction" />
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(LogoutAction))
                            {
                                <form method="post" action="@LogoutAction">
                                    <AntiforgeryToken />
                                    <button type="submit" class="ep-menu-item">@L["登出"]</button>
                                </form>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
            </aside>

            <div class="ep-portal-stage">
                <header class="ep-shell-top">
                    <button type="button" class="ep-side-toggle ep-portal-mobile-toggle" aria-controls="ep-side" aria-expanded="true" aria-label="@L["展開或收合導覽"]"><NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Menu" /></button>
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(HomeHref))
                    {
                        <a class="ep-brand" href="@HomeHref"><BrandMark />@Brand.Name</a>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <span class="ep-brand"><BrandMark />@Brand.Name</span>
                    }
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(TenantName))
                    {
                        <span class="ep-portal-tenant">@TenantName</span>
                    }
                    @if (CurrentStageTitle() is { Length: > 0 } stageTitle)
                    {
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(TenantName))
                        {
                            <span class="ep-portal-crumb-sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
                        }
                        <span class="ep-portal-route" title="@stageTitle">@stageTitle</span>
                    }
                    <span class="ep-spacer"></span>
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(HomeHref))
                    {
                        <a class="ep-portal-new-chat" href="@HomeHref"><NavIcon Path="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Add" /><span>@L["新對話"]</span></a>
                    }
                </header>

                <main class="ep-console-main" id="main" tabindex="-1">
                    @ChildContent
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    }
    else
    {
        <header class="ep-shell-top">
            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(HomeHref))
            {
                <a class="ep-brand" href="@HomeHref"><BrandMark />@Brand.Name</a>
            }
            else
            {
                <span class="ep-brand"><BrandMark />@Brand.Name</span>
            }
            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(TenantName))
            {
                <span class="ep-portal-tenant">@TenantName</span>
            }
            <span class="ep-spacer"></span>

            @if (ShowMenu)
            {
                <button type="button" class="ep-avatar" popovertarget="ep-account-menu" aria-label="@L["帳號選單"]">@AvatarText</button>
                <div id="ep-account-menu" class="ep-menu" popover>
                    <p class="ep-menu-who">
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(UserDisplayName) && !string.Equals(UserDisplayName, UserEmail, StringComparison.Ordinal))
                        {
                            <strong>@UserDisplayName</strong>
                        }
                        <span>@UserEmail</span>
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(RoleLabel))
                        {
                            <span class="ep-secondary">@RoleLabel</span>
                        }
                    </p>
                    <nav aria-label="@L["帳號選單"]">
                        @foreach (var item in MenuItems)
                        {
                            <a class="ep-menu-item" href="@item.Href">@item.Label</a>
                        }
                    </nav>
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(LanguageAction))
                    {
                        <LanguageSwitch Action="@LanguageAction" />
                    }
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(LogoutAction))
                    {
                        <form method="post" action="@LogoutAction">
                            <AntiforgeryToken />
                            <button type="submit" class="ep-menu-item">@L["登出"]</button>
                        </form>
                    }
                </div>
            }
            else
            {
                @* 還沒登入，或還在改初始密碼、註冊驗證器（只開那一頁，沒有選單）：頂欄只留語言與登出。 *@
                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(LanguageAction))
                {
                    <LanguageSwitch Action="@LanguageAction" />
                }
                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(LogoutAction))
                {
                    <form method="post" action="@LogoutAction">
                        <AntiforgeryToken />
                        <button type="submit" class="ep-btn ep-btn-quiet">@L["登出"]</button>
                    </form>
                }
            }
        </header>

        <main class="ep-shell-main" id="main" tabindex="-1">
            @ChildContent
        </main>
    }
</div>

@code {
    public sealed record MenuItem(string Href, string Label);

    /// <param name="Id">選單的元素 Id 與錨點名稱用它區分項目。</param>
    /// <param name="Href">對話頁；釘選、重新命名、刪除的表單 POST 到它底下（<c>/pin</c>、<c>/rename</c>、<c>/delete</c>）。</param>
    /// <param name="Title">對話的標題（預設是第一個問題，可改名）；是使用者的資料，不翻譯。</param>
    public sealed record RecentConversation(Guid Id, string Href, string Title, bool Pinned);

    public sealed record RecentGroup(string Label, IReadOnlyList<RecentConversation> Items);

    /// <summary>側欄的最近對話，已依日期分好組；沒有就整段不畫（問答歷史沒開啟、還沒問過）。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public IReadOnlyList<RecentGroup> Recent { get; set; } = [];

    /// <param name="Group">側欄的群組標題；同一群組的項目連續排列。</param>
    /// <param name="Exact">只有網址完全相同才標成目前頁（首頁要這樣，否則每一頁都算在首頁底下）。</param>
    /// <param name="Icon">項目前面的圖示（MudBlazor 的 Material 圖示常數）；收成窄欄時只剩它，所以每一項都該有。</param>
    public sealed record NavItem(string Href, string Label, string Group, bool Exact = false, string? Icon = null);

    [Parameter]
    public string? TenantName { get; set; }

    /// <summary>品牌字的連結：回到問答首頁。尚未登入時沒有。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? HomeHref { get; set; }

    /// <summary>問答歷史是否開啟；開啟時即使尚未有對話也會顯示原生對話歷史區。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public bool HistoryEnabled { get; set; }

    /// <summary>對話紀錄與搜尋頁的路徑（歷史開啟時帶入）。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? HistoryHref { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public string? UserDisplayName { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public string? UserEmail { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public string? RoleLabel { get; set; }

    private string? UserSecondaryLine => !string.IsNullOrEmpty(RoleLabel)
        ? RoleLabel
        : !string.IsNullOrEmpty(UserDisplayName) && !string.Equals(UserDisplayName, UserEmail, StringComparison.Ordinal)
            ? UserEmail
            : null;

    /// <summary>頭像圓鈕上的一個字（名字或 email 的第一個字）。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string AvatarText { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>登出表單的 action；沒有就不畫登出（尚未登入、或展示頁）。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? LogoutAction { get; set; }

    /// <summary>已登入、而且沒有待辦的強制步驟才有帳號選單。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public bool ShowMenu { get; set; }

    /// <summary>換介面語言的端點；沒有就不畫語言選項（展示頁）。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? LanguageAction { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public IReadOnlyList<MenuItem> MenuItems { get; set; } = [];

    [Parameter]
    public IReadOnlyList<NavItem> NavItems { get; set; } = [];

    private bool HasSideNav => ShowMenu && NavItems.Count > 0;

    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }

    private string? CurrentStageTitle()
    {
        if (!Uri.TryCreate(Nav.Uri, UriKind.Absolute, out var current))
            return null;

        var path = NormalizePath(current.AbsolutePath);

        foreach (var group in Recent)
        {
            foreach (var conv in group.Items)
            {
                if (string.Equals(NormalizePath(conv.Href), path, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))
                    return conv.Title;
            }
        }

        foreach (var item in NavItems.Where(i => i.Exact))
        {
            if (string.Equals(NormalizePath(item.Href), path, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))
                return item.Label;
        }

        var prefixMatch = NavItems
            .Where(i => !i.Exact && path.StartsWith(NormalizePath(i.Href), StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))
            .OrderByDescending(i => i.Href.Length)
            .FirstOrDefault();
        if (prefixMatch is not null)
            return prefixMatch.Label;

        return MenuItems.FirstOrDefault(m => path.StartsWith(NormalizePath(m.Href), StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))?.Label;
    }

    private static string NormalizePath(string href)
    {
        var cut = href.IndexOfAny(['?', '#']);
        var path = cut >= 0 ? href[..cut] : href;
        return path.Length > 1 ? path.TrimEnd('/') : path;
    }
}
